---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { contact } from '../config/contact';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Sarasudha handles information collected through this website."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy Policy" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow prose">
      <p>Last updated: 14 August 2026</p>

      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        Sarasudha (sarasudha.in) is, in its current phase, a static website. No analytics or
        tracking scripts run by default, and no cookies are set for tracking purposes. If
        analytics are enabled in the future, this policy will be updated first, and the
        integration is documented in the project README so the change is never silent.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact form</h2>
      <p>
        If you use the contact form and it is connected to a live submission service, the
        information you provide (name, email, phone if given, reason, message) is sent to that
        service in order to respond to your enquiry. It is not sold or used for advertising. If no
        submission service is configured, the form does not send your information anywhere — this
        is stated on the page itself.
      </p>

      <h2>Archive contributions</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact Sarasudha to contribute photographs, recordings or documents, any personal
        information you share (such as your name or contact details) is used only to coordinate
        that contribution.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party embeds</h2>
      <p>
        Performance videos, where available, are embedded from YouTube using its privacy-enhanced
        mode and only load after you choose to play them — not automatically when the page loads.
        Playing a video is subject to YouTube's own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Compliance status</h2>
      <p>
        This policy describes current practice. It does not represent a formal assessment of
        compliance with any specific data protection law, and no such claim is made here or
        elsewhere on this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {contact.email ? (
          <>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.</>
        ) : (
          <>Questions about this policy can be sent through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</>
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .prose h2 {
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--color-maroon);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
